   - Fix: nest it as `metadata:\n  version: 0.1.0 # x-release-please-version`. release-please's generic updater matches the annotation by line content regardless of YAML nesting depth, so the `extra-files` entry in unit 2 needs no change. Update the "Version lockstep" behavior/test description in `tasks.md` to assert `frontmatter.metadata.version` instead of a top-level `version` field.
